# Rows

## l1: The Drowned Keep (place, in the scene)
- description: "A fortress half sunk into the marsh."
- condition: "Flooded to the second stair."
- placement: The Marsh
- keywords: ["the keep"]

## i1: The sigil (item, off the scene)
- description: ""
- condition: ""
- keywords: []

# Happenings not yet common knowledge
- hp1: The ford ambush",
}
`;

